        "created_at": "2025-07-11T06:48:55.462Z",
        "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sayan\">@sayan</a> Sir I am repeating the full SC course and previously I have submitted three BPTs BPT1, BPT2 and BPT4, for this term in my virtual machines in status all test cases are passed</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/6/b/6b8346a010d84046f6434befa7669667dafd5552.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/fl6lunJbLXWZMc2haWCVFqqhB4K.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/6/b/6b8346a010d84046f6434befa7669667dafd5552_2_690x182.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"fl6lunJbLXWZMc2haWCVFqqhB4K\" width=\"690\" height=\"182\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/6/b/6b8346a010d84046f6434befa7669667dafd5552_2_690x182.png, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/6/b/6b8346a010d84046f6434befa7669667dafd5552_2_1035x273.png 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/6/b/6b8346a010d84046f6434befa7669667dafd5552_2_1380x364.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"171717\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1887×499 36.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>But in my dashboard for BPT2 it is showing Absent and BPT1 is showing 100 and also received the mail that We have not received your submission for BPT 1 and 2</p>\n<p>What should I do?</p>",
