        "created_at": "2025-07-11T07:56:31.861Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/22f3002985\">@22f3002985</a></p>\n<p>If you are repeating the entire course, you must do <strong>synchro eval before the deadline</strong> for BPTs to be marked as submitted.</p>\n<p>From the screenshot, I can see you ran synchro eval on BPT1 on 26th May so, BPT 1 submission was taken into consideration. But you didn’t do the same for BPT2, that’s why you got 0 for BPT 2.</p>\n<p>Remember to run synchro eval from BPT3 onwards before the deadline &amp; after its release date.</p>\n<p>As for the mail, which says BPT1 as not attempted, you can ignore that.</p>\n<p>Thanks &amp; Regards,<br>\nSwati Jain</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
