  "accepted_answer": {
    "post_number": 2,
    "username": "21f3000759",
    "name": null,
    "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/21f3000759/{size}/23528_2.png",
    "excerpt": "<p>Hello <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/22f3002985\">@22f3002985</a></p>\n<p>If you are repeating the entire course, you must do <strong>synchro eval before the deadline</strong> for BPTs to be marked as submitted.</p>\n<p>From the screenshot, I can see you ran synchro eval on BPT1 on 26th May so, BPT 1 submission was taken into consideration. But you didn’t do the same for BPT2, that’s why you got 0 for BPT 2.</p>\n<p>Remember to run synchro eval from BPT3 onwards before the deadline &amp; after its release date.</p>\n<p>As for the mail, which says BPT1 as not attempted, you can ignore that.</p>\n<p>Thanks &amp; Regards,<br>\nSwati Jain</p>",
    "accepter_name": null,
    "accepter_username": "sayan"
  },
